openconnect-fortinet-saml (1.0.2-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * debian/control: declare Provides/Conflicts/Replaces on libopenconnect5
    (versioned Provides = 9.12). The package ships the patched
    libopenconnect.so.5; without this, network-manager-openconnect's
    "libopenconnect5 (>= 8.20~)" dependency pulled the stock lib, which
    collided with the patched one.

 -- Michele Palazzi <sysdadmin@m1k.cloud>  Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

openconnect-fortinet-saml (1.0.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * ssl.c: extend disable_ipv6 to skip AAAA on outer gateway resolution
    too. Removes the need for an /etc/hosts override on dual-stack-DNS
    gateways that listen on IPv4 only.

 -- Michele Palazzi <sysdadmin@m1k.cloud>  Sat, 30 May 2026 00:30:00 +0200

openconnect-fortinet-saml (1.0.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging of the fork.
  * Fortinet SAML/SSO support based on upstream MR !632.
  * Restored gnutls_pkcs11_init() workaround for gnutls#1798.
  * Local per-host overrides framework via
    /etc/openconnect/local-overrides.conf (flags: force-saml,
    force-ext-browser, disable-ipv6).

 -- Michele Palazzi <sysdadmin@m1k.cloud>  Fri, 29 May 2026 23:50:00 +0200
